    "priceNumeric": 1100,
    "description": "The Omron E3FA-DP12 is a compact, cylindrical diffuse-reflective photoelectric sensor designed for reliable object detection in industrial automation systems. 🔹 Detailed Description The E3FA-DP12 is part of Omron&rsquo;s E3FA series and is built for non-contact detection of objects using reflected light. It emits a red LED beam , and when an object enters the sensing area, the reflected light is detected and the sensor switches its output. It is widely used in continuous industrial processes , where accurate and fast detection is required, such as conveyors, packaging, and assembly lines. 🔹 Construction & Design Shape: Cylindrical (M18 threaded body) Housing material: Durable ABS plastic Compact size: Easy mounting in tight spaces Cable type: Pre-wired (typically 2 m cable) The rugged design provides high resistance to dust, water, and washdown conditions with IP67/IP69K protection . 🔹 Working Principle Uses diffuse reflection method Sensor emits light &rarr; object reflects light &rarr; receiver detects it Output changes based on detection (presence/absence of object) 🔹 Key Technical Description Sensing distance: Up to 300 mm (depending on target) Light source: Red LED (~624 nm) Output type: PNP (open collector) Operation modes: Light-ON / Dark-ON selectable Supply voltage: 10–30 V DC Response time: ~0.5 ms (high-speed detection) 🔹 Functional Features Adjustable sensitivity (single-turn potentiometer) Visible LED indicators for operation and stability Protection circuits : Reverse polarity protection Short-circuit protection Stable detection even in harsh industrial environments 🔹 Typical Applications Conveyor object detection Bottle/carton detection Packaging machines Assembly automation Food & beverage industries 🔹 Summary The E3FA-DP12 is a reliable, compact, and easy-to-install photoelectric sensor that offers stable short-range detection (up to 300 mm) with high durability, making it ideal for industrial automation and high-speed production lines .",
